window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-053-9003f4217e9258b7.json"]={sha256:"9003f4217e9258b7d665529380942bb44d082bb667699eb1307b41ee0e8680ca",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-30f368cdd1d99110","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1","title":"Fusion-based quantum computation","titleEn":"Fusion-based quantum computation","publisher":"Bartolucci et al. / Nature Communications","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-053","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-053","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-054","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7"],"title":"PsiQuantum Omega：Hong–Ou–Mandel 可見度","titleEn":"PsiQuantum Omega: Hong–Ou–Mandel visibility","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：僅在無光控制的旗標率符合背景模型時報告可用融合率，並保留條件保真度的分母。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report usable fusion rates only when no-light heralds match the background model; retain the conditional-fidelity denominator. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"由符合計數推導可見度，並保留背景扣除的不確定性。","differenceEn":"Derive visibility from coincidence counts while retaining uncertainty from background subtraction.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。內在融合成功率0.5；兩路總透射均0.8，每秒100000次嘗試。 R=R嘗試×p_f×η₁×η₂。 代入 100000*0.5*0.8**2，得到 32000 events/s。獨立損耗下P成功=p_f η₁η₂；此模型忽略暗計數與錯誤宣告。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。遠離重疊時符合計數1000，零延遲時100，曝光相同且此題不扣背景。 V=1−C零/C遠。 代入 1-100/1000，得到 0.9 dimensionless。V=(C遠−C零)/C遠；需相同曝光與穩定背景，且可見度不是完整閘保真度。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Intrinsic success0.5, transmission0.8 on each arm and100000 attempts/s. R=attempt rate×p_f×η1×η2. Substituting 100000*0.5*0.8**2 gives 32000 events/s. With independent loss Psuccess=p_f η1η2; dark counts and false heralds are excluded. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Far-delay coincidences1000, zero-delay coincidences100, equal exposure, no background subtraction here. V=1−Czero/Cfar. Substituting 1-100/1000 gives 0.9 dimensionless. V=(Cfar−Czero)/Cfar requires equal exposure and stable background; visibility is not full gate fidelity. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-063","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x"],"title":"自旋到電荷讀出：混淆矩陣與平均保真度","titleEn":"Spin-to-charge readout: confusion matrices and mean fidelity","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：僅在無光控制的旗標率符合背景模型時報告可用融合率，並保留條件保真度的分母。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report usable fusion rates only when no-light heralds match the background model; retain the conditional-fidelity denominator. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"由兩類條件正確率建立讀出混淆矩陣，避免用不平衡樣本隱藏弱類別。","differenceEn":"Build a readout confusion matrix from class-conditional accuracy without hiding a weak class in imbalanced samples.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。內在融合成功率0.5；兩路總透射均0.8，每秒100000次嘗試。 R=R嘗試×p_f×η₁×η₂。 代入 100000*0.5*0.8**2，得到 32000 events/s。獨立損耗下P成功=p_f η₁η₂；此模型忽略暗計數與錯誤宣告。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。準備0與1各1000次，正確分類980與940次；本題先假設準備完美。 F=(980/1000+940/1000)/2。 代入 (980/1000+940/1000)/2，得到 0.96 dimensionless。均勻先驗下平均指派保真度F=(P(0|0)+P(1|1))/2；真實先驗不均時總準確率不同。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Intrinsic success0.5, transmission0.8 on each arm and100000 attempts/s. R=attempt rate×p_f×η1×η2. Substituting 100000*0.5*0.8**2 gives 32000 events/s. With independent loss Psuccess=p_f η1η2; dark counts and false heralds are excluded. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Prepare0 and1 each1000 times; classify980 and940 correctly, initially assuming perfect preparation. F=(980/1000+940/1000)/2. Substituting (980/1000+940/1000)/2 gives 0.96 dimensionless. For equal priors assignment fidelityF=[P(0|0)+P(1|1)]/2; overall accuracy differs with unequal priors. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-fd900ae8f3096a90","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x","title":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","titleEn":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","publisher":"Philips et al. / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
